A toolkit for interacting with Thinkst Canary data in Gravwell.

This kit includes:
- Actionables
- Alerts
- Autoextractors
- Dashboards
- Flows
- Macros
- Playbooks
- Queries
- Resources
- Scheduled searches
- Templates

Refer to these playbooks for detailed configuration and setup information:
-
[Thinkst Canary - Integration Guide](/playbooks/5edc675d-7e8a-4aa5-b55e-cbf62549b3af)
-
[Thinkst Canary - Kit Overview](/playbooks/d79e13b7-73dd-474c-82b4-5939a9f6a2ac)
